Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:17.27,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:22.37,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to get from Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:28.34,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:35.90,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't think of something fast, it might be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.80,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,He's coming from somewhere really far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.24,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:46.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey. What's the thing you want the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.44,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Lop ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:51.15,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.05,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Her best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:07.36,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.36,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:10.96,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really late...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.58,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:14.67,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:20.31,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.24,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.81,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... it's stuff from work...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:41.85,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we set up the tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.85,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:03.19,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:09.69,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This goes on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:10.83,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.{I think?  Line missed in TL -Fan}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:24.55,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.00,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Our house doesn't have a chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:34.47,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa will find a way. It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.60,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll leave the doors unlocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:41.64,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.78,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:58.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's for the reindeers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.86,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I turn it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.82,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:18.52,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa won't come if you don't go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.93,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.14,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.55,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I also wanted to meet you, Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:02.10,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.45,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.29,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you too, reindeer!
